			(property "Description" "Common-mode choke, 2 coupled pairs (H3a §c EMC insurance position): pins 1/2 = differential-pair IN (H/L), pins 3/4 = differential-pair OUT (H/L) -- one part couples both lines through a shared core; NEVER substitute two independent series beads on the individual lines (defeats the common-mode rejection). Provisioned DNP by default; populate only on EMC evidence. MPN/footprint TBD (H3a is judicious-not-blanket; not yet part-searched)."
